@startuml
' System architecture (C4 level 2-3) — Azure web architecture decorated
' with FluentUI UI affordances. Demonstrates the canonical Azure +
' FluentUI mixed pattern: Azure service icons carry the infrastructure
' backbone; FluentUI icons label cloud-boundary, identity, auth, status,
' and notifications.
'
' Source: https://github.com/hanv89/archicon
' License: MIT (this diagram); see repo LICENSE.
' Icons:
'   Microsoft Azure architecture icons via Azure-PlantUML upstream (MIT)
'     — subject to Microsoft Azure Architecture Icons ToU + Trademark
'     Guidelines; see repo NOTICE.
'   Microsoft Fluent UI System Icons via microsoft/fluentui-system-icons
'     (MIT, Microsoft Corporation 2020) — subject to the Microsoft
'     Trademark and Brand Guidelines; see repo NOTICE.
'
' Render: paste this file's content into
'   https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/
' The PlantUML server fetches each <img:URL> at render time.

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

title Azure web architecture decorated with FluentUI UI affordances

actor "User\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/person_48_color.png>" as user

' ----- Azure backbone -----
rectangle "**Azure Front Door**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Azure/Networking/AzureFrontDoor.png>\nglobal entry + WAF" as afd

rectangle "**Azure App Service**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Azure/Compute/AzureAppService.png>\nweb backend" as appsvc

rectangle "**Azure SQL Database**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Azure/Databases/AzureSqlDatabase.png>\nuser + order data" as sql

rectangle "**Azure Active Directory**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Azure/Identity/AzureActiveDirectory.png>\nIDP" as aad

' ----- FluentUI decorators (clustered for visual grouping) -----
rectangle "**Cloud boundary**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/cloud_48_color.png>\nAll resources inside the Azure tenant" as cloud_boundary

rectangle "**Identity + AuthN**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/shield_48_color.png>\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/person_add_48_color.png>\nLogin + new-user onboarding flow" as auth_panel

rectangle "**Status panel**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/checkmark_circle_32_color.png>  All checks green\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/warning_32_color.png>  Latency degraded\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/alert_32_color.png>  New incidents" as status_panel

rectangle "**Org context**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/building_32_color.png>  Enterprise tenant\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/FluentUI/png/calendar_32_color.png>  Maintenance window: Sun 02:00-04:00 UTC" as org_panel

' ----- Flow -----
user -right-> afd : HTTPS
afd -right-> appsvc
appsvc -right-> sql : T-SQL
appsvc -down-> aad : OAuth2 token validation

' ----- Decorator anchors (dotted lines to indicate labelling, not data flow) -----
cloud_boundary -.[#888]-> afd
cloud_boundary -.[#888]-> appsvc
cloud_boundary -.[#888]-> sql
cloud_boundary -.[#888]-> aad
auth_panel    -.[#888]-> aad
status_panel  -.[#888]-> appsvc
org_panel     -.[#888]-> cloud_boundary

@enduml
